# Project — ShelfLedger

- Path: `/srv/ShelfLedger`. Product: **ShelfLedger** — generic retail inventory + GST billing ERP (not ecommerce). First vertical: footwear.
- Pitchable brand: do not rename product back to “Footwear ERP” in UI or README.
- Inventory: never store authoritative qty on products; ledger + transactional balances.
- Average costing; soft delete; no hard delete of financial/inventory rows.
- V1 GST: **CGST + SGST only** (same-state). Do not implement IGST flows in V1.
- DB: shared `edunex-postgres`, dedicated DB/role `shelfledger` (never superuser `edunex` in app URL).
- Planned host: `shelfledger.edunexservices.in` via Caddy on `vps_edge`.
- Stack: Next.js App Router, Prisma, PostgreSQL, Tailwind, shadcn, RHF, TanStack Table/Query, Zod.
- Deploy: Docker; only Caddy on 80/8443; private `shelfledger_internal`; update `/srv/scripts/PORT_REGISTRY.md` before host binds.
- Execute per `docs/phases.md`. Current phase in `docs/memory.md`.
- Never forget: no Prisma in UI; Zod on server; phase-by-phase delivery.
